{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Wastelands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a hardcore RPG fan or prefer a relaxed idle experience, <strong>Legends of Wastelands</strong> offers an adventure pace that\u2019s entirely your own. Auto-battle, limitless customization, and endless growth\u2014your legendary journey starts here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Classes, Endless Paths</strong><br>Choose from three core classes\u2014Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence\u2014plus three hybrid branches for six unique growth routes. Each class can advance and specialize through multiple promotions, unlocking distinctive skills and playstyles to craft a combat style that\u2019s truly your own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Talent System, Unique Heroes</strong><br>With over 1,700 talent nodes spanning basic stats and special effects, you can progress steadily or commit to extreme builds\u2014the direction of growth is entirely in your hands. Each class also has an exclusive talent tree, offering deeper strategy and customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/6d07ebfba250cf92d23c5110d4b61107.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/6d07ebfba250cf92d23c5110d4b61107.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/6d07ebfba250cf92d23c5110d4b61107.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills and Gems, Infinite Combos</strong><br>Learn over 100 skills without class restrictions, then combine them with talent trees to unleash powerful synergies. Dozens of support gems transform skill behavior, turning even familiar moves into fresh combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Battle Modes, Your Choice of Challenge</strong><br>Take on story stages, expeditions, boss battles, or timed challenges. Relax with idle progression or engage in intense fights to earn rare rewards and test your ultimate builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet Companions, Growing Together</strong><br>Hatch eggs and raise pets with unique abilities and traits. Pets assist in combat and generate offline rewards, ensuring your growth continues even when you\u2019re away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Crafting, Pursue Perfection</strong><br>Defeat enemies for equipment with core stats and random modifiers. Upgrade, reroll, and add affixes at the blacksmith to forge your perfect gear over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/fd535b47996107983fd58f64f308dac9.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/fd535b47996107983fd58f64f308dac9.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/fd535b47996107983fd58f64f308dac9.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007300?t=1768188582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/ae4c506a6a77cac24368e5b1fd026c7081be24c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768188582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/409d528e70e2a326767aab9d095874f11a21376c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768188582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/409d528e70e2a326767aab9d095874f11a21376c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768188582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4207250,"description":""}