nt trees to unleash powerful synergies. Dozens of support gems transform skill behavior, turning even familiar moves into fresh combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/b5fcaee75d5b65ab3b68e6c991083674.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Battle Modes, Your Choice of Challenge</strong><br>Take on story stages, expeditions, boss battles, or timed challenges. Relax with idle progression or engage in intense fights to earn rare rewards and test your ultimate builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet Companions, Growing Together</strong><br>Hatch eggs and raise pets with unique abilities and traits. Pets assist in combat and generate offline rewards, ensuring your growth continues even when you\u2019re away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.poster.avif?t=1768188582\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.webm?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007300/extras/5a30fe2936b55bf225d62e1964d9f704.mp4?t=1768188582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr